	"system": {
		"description": "<p>The bonds that you experienced as you grew up in this culture have given you a strong perspective on Found Family. At the end of a long rest in a safe haven, choose a number of creatures up to your Wisdom modifier (minimum 1). When you attempt to Help these creatures or use a spell or ability that heals or repairs them as an action, you may instead spend a bonus action to do so. You may use this benefit a number of times per short rest equal to your Proficiency Bonus.</p>",
